   "title": "Biology: cellular respiration",
   "body": "# Biology: cellular respiration\n\n**Equation:** C6H12O6 + 6 O2 → 6 CO2 + 6 H2O + energy (ATP)\n\n## Stages\n1. Glycolysis: cytoplasm, 2 ATP\n2. Krebs cycle: mitochondrial matrix\n3. Electron transport chain: inner membrane, ~34 ATP\n\n- [x] Review diagram on p. 112\n- [ ] Ask about anaerobic pathways\n",
   "course": "2ea2a9d328e5dda749054cea74fc7e5c",
   "pinned": false,
